      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 5 for SLE 15 SP6)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for the Linux Kernel 6.4.0-150600_23_25 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2024-53237: Bluetooth: fix use-after-free in device_for_each_child() (bsc#1235008).\n- CVE-2024-53082: virtio_net: Add hash_key_length check (bsc#1233677).\n- CVE-2024-8805: Bluetooth: hci_event: Align BR/EDR JUST_WORKS paring with LE (bsc#1240840).\n- CVE-2024-56650: netfilter: x_tables: fix LED ID check in led_tg_check() (bsc#1235431).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "details",
        "text": "SUSE-2025-1468,SUSE-2025-1469,SUSE-2025-1470,SUSE-SLE-Module-Live-Patching-15-SP6-2025-1473",
